0000108A                           128  ; --- KEYBOARD BITFIELD MASKS ------------------------------------------------------------
0000108A                           129  ;
0000108A                           130  ; CONVENIENCE CONSTANTS TO ACCESS THE FOLLOWING BIT-FIELD. THIS BIT-FIELD IS USED BY:
