0000108A                           133  ;   - KEYBOARD_EDGE
0000108A                           134  ;
0000108A                           135  ; +------+---+---+---+---+
0000108A                           136  ; | 0000 | 3 | 2 | 1 | 0 |
0000108A                           137  ; +------+---+---+---+---+
0000108A                           138  ;          |   |   |   |
0000108A                           139  ;          |   |   |   +---------- LEFT BUTTON
0000108A                           140  ;          |   |   +-------------- UP BUTTON
0000108A                           141  ;          |   +------------------ RIGHT BUTTON
0000108A                           142  ;          +---------------------- DOWN BUTTON
0000108A                           143  
